# The @rivus/api container build uses the monorepo root as its context; keep it
# lean and never copy host-built artifacts or secrets into the image.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.astro
**/.expo
**/.wrangler
**/.turbo
**/.docula
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.dev.vars

# Design-system source archive (visual reference only; DESIGN_SYSTEM.md is the spec)
*.mhtml
